> > > Good Day,
> > > 
> > > the following is a snip from 
> > > 
> > > /alsa-driver-0.9.3a/alsa-kernel/usb/usbaudio.c
> > > 
> > >        /* FIXME: needed support for TYPE II and III */
> > >         if (format_type != USB_FORMAT_TYPE_I) {
